testcafe-tutorial

This project originated as the `testcafe/` proof of concept within
test_advisory_board, an Apache-2.0 licensed repository:

    https://github.com/rolyatwilson/test_advisory_board

The TestCafe example in that repository was written by Michael Swailes in
May 2019 and is extracted here with its original commit history intact. The
repository's other proofs of concept (Pact for Ruby and Java) were written by
other contributors and are not included.

